5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I wonder if we should check who is actually doing the extra work before we pick a project.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,That is a thoughtful point. I am also curious about the practical conditions that might affect delivery timelines.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I am concerned about where the money actually comes from. We need to know the budget source before committing to anything.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"I’m curious what actually happened to the last three projects we funded. Did they stick around, or did they quietly disappear?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I keep thinking about the small, daily frustrations on the floor. Maybe we should look at where we actually lose time each week.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,#### Turn 2 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
