13,1,2,talk,May,,- **Minato**: I think we should look into the staffing of the coordination group to see who is really carrying the load.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,- **Minato**: I think we should look into the staffing of the coordination group to see who is really carrying the load.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,- **Minato**: I agree with looking at the staffing. It helps us see who is really carrying the load.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: I would like to check the network coverage at customer plants, as that often dictates whether field work is even possible.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,- **George**: I will look into the capital budget and software allowance to see what is actually available.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,- **May**: I will check the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts to see what actually survived.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,- **Midori**: I will look into the time lost to copying existing records to understand our daily inefficiencies.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,- **Minato**: I will also look into the record of cross-unit standardization efforts to see what actually stuck.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: I will also check in-house developer availability, since we cannot build anything if no one is free to write the code.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,"- **George**: I will also look into vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work, as that determines our long-term costs.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,"- **May**: I will also look into the handling of vendor queries, to see if we are repeating the same administrative errors.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Midori,,- **Midori**: I will also look into misrouted deliveries in the incident logs to see how often we repeat the same mistakes.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
