66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: A fixed-fee build handles the initial setup, so we avoid the developer bottleneck. Maintenance can be minimal if the catalog is simple.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
